ta and allowing them to process it. The training phase is minimal, focusing on adjusting the output weights to fit the desired output, while the reservoir's weights remain fixed. This makes ESNs efficient for real-time and online learning tasks.","role":"assistant"},"model":"qwen2.5:7b","prompt_eval_count":1060,"prompt_eval_duration":45587000,"total_duration":2017370500}}